      "annotation_id": "b9057581c56c4aaa9cce060b6a063f57_28",
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "labels": [
        "RLC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_labels:RLC"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\n Appellants/Pankaj Kumar Pandey and Lal Babu Yadav  have further been sentenced to undergo R.I. for ten  years, to pay a fine of Rs. 5,000/- each and in default  of payment of fine, to further suffer R.I. for three  months for the offence "
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "0b93d1721a7f48019e2733e280023e7b_29",
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "labels": [
        "RLC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_labels:RLC"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Appellant/Lal Babu Yadav has also been  sentenced to undergo R.I. for three years, to pay a fine  of Rs. 5,000/- and in default of payment of fine, to  further suffer R.I. for three months for the offence  under Section 27(1) of the Arms Ac"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "eeff216a9fbb49e5b0adea53b407fd1c_30",
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "labels": [
        "RLC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_labels:RLC"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "8. The sentences have been ordered to run  concurrently."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "9ef346ba72b44a11a40f9c5619300c5d_59",
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "labels": [
        "RLC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_labels:RLC"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "12. The Trial Court, after having examined six witnesses on behalf of the prosecution and one formal witness as a Court witness, convicted and sentenced the appellants as aforesaid."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "7af01dc144584ad9a029d0350b47bc23_62",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\n15. Neither the I.O. nor the Doctor have been examined at the Trial and there is no explanation whatsoever for their non-examination."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "967a3686b5cf45e3adc2894fad986378_64",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "17. It would, thus, be relevant to refer to the deposition of P.W. 4 only."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "44cf2166274c404e8a3c7c4834f1ab87_67",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Nothing relevant appears to have been asked from him either by the defence or by the Court."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "92fb88e93131476b9eca0b6e983c78b9_68",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Nonetheless, we would refer to some part of his deposition, which would make the prosecution story appears like a cock and bull story and nothing more."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "0a40b974b48a421db02c7e9b6e1d4200_69",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "19. P.W. 4 has stated before the Trial Court that while going to the market for purchase of battery for his house, he met appellants/Lal Babu Yadav and Pankaj Kumar Pandey, on whose insistence, he went to appellant/Binod Das at his shop for"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "6ceff4e197434e03a5e562888d9b9aca_70",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "One of the co-accused persons, since acquitted, namely, Rajesh Das was also there."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "50f90923d9d44d8982c42eb69c46d36b_108",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "22. True it is that such suggestions were vehemently denied by P.W. 4, but the story suggested Patna High Court CR. APP (DB) No.202 of 2016 dt.03-05-2024 by him does not at all inspire confidence that he is telling the truth."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "c6391c6043fb41e99a38495ba093c2e5_109",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "This witness have prevaricated and tergiversated a number of times for him to be believed as a reliable witness."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "6df85dd3595e4d28b221236c42450d03_110",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "He was kidnapped from the village and from in front of the house of appellant/Lal Babu Yadav."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "a87caa3d49de4869a5ade83b0db9b0b7_111",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "It was not an unearthly hour when he was blind-folded and taken to sugarcane filed."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "a37c3b3990af465c805fb127fd75106f_112",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Nobody noticed it!"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "40e90b48c42948fc87d12485efcf643a_113",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "23. There is also nothing on record to indicate that there was any demand of ransom from his family."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "b3d139653d0b42a3bf63379d34e74731_114",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "He was not even made to talk to his brothers for arranging Rs. 3,00,000/-."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "4a54c71315854f1e89231b9a8c78316d_115",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "There was no written communication whatsoever."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "161585e1f44d49408b4864c8906db38a_116",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Unless P.W. 4 would have known the appellants from before,\nBinod Das vs The State Of Bihar on 3 May, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/131954653/\n6"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "922d7d8289174af4bc736cd0f3929d9a_117",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "he would not have otherwise agreed to go with them at the shop of appellant/Binod Das."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "37ee9acad7b646e487cfcaca64102493_118",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The other suggestions which were denied by him were about some rivalry at the hustings where his family members and the family members of the appellants had contested for local body Patna High Court CR."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "dcde80ecdd75451e83cd3855c85ce859_119",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "APP (DB) No.202 of 2016 dt.03-05-2024 positions."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "c4f0e14fc5a24ffe845cfd645d264217_120",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "24. That apart, it is difficult to accept the story of P.W. 4 that he was hit by a bullet as a result of which he had fallen down and then got up of his own after ten minutes and tied his wound by opening his shirt."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "3e2e5a6bbf4d49589bfc4907de19768e_121",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "25. The story is not limited to this only."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "b7434b9d47704e948b9f19302b6fd3ee_122",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "He trudged to some distance and came to the road where he found two persons on bicycle who offered to help."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "01e479315fc04fe696ce42099e59fbb7_123",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "He was brought on a bicycle near his home."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "613b88f94dbe470cb246672c5d55f5a4_124",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Why had those persons left him outside his house also is inexplicable."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "4f43800d10744b078b7145bd640f6712_125",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Their identity also remains completely unknown."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "ef04d92b52dc4e7395d6f8d88eb65418_126",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "If they had helped P.W. 4 in bringing him to his home after knowing that he had a gunshot wound on his body, it would only have been natural for them to have met the family members of P.W. 4."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "ba8ba9c69a2c484da2d079b6500eacce_127",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Their running away after reaching P.W. 4, somewhere near his house, raises many eye-brows."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "1ec072eeecfc4983a0dbc64dc1d99b64_128",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "26. The story, therefore, is absolutely Patna High Court CR."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "f28289316b564a80abb939203eaa9d5c_129",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "APP (DB) No.202 of 2016 dt.03-05-2024 unreliable."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "df94a4e3effe43f4b2b32ba44e762b4c_130",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "27. The complexity has further been confounded with the non-examination of the I.O. and the Doctor."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "7a3dffaeae5e4fcf82219f8e608a50ff_131",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "28. There is nothing on record to indicate and prove that P.W. 4 was taken to any hospital."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "16c14eba0e0c429489658b33642b0161_132",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "In his long cross-examination, he has spoken about his having been treated at Chautarva; MJK Hospital,\nBettiah; and for several days at Patna."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "88ae5c8d382740dfa8ad3cfc36fe7b71_133",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Without any record of such treatment, such story by P.W. 4 cannot at all be believed."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "347acfc3c47f48058f8eb0e561cbf6bb_134",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "If the deceased was hit in his back from ten meters by appellant/Lal Babu Yadav, he would have bled profusely and would not have been in a position to walk or travel to such great distance."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "844953bb537d4b3bb0d08e5b4c691c07_135",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The police was immediately informed after P.W. 4 was brought to the hospital."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "55a4459d5f5f495f8d5b69760d4f73eb_136",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "There was no reason for the police not to have visited the hospital."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "a5bd4d8a168045cb80c09a4b34a7d81e_137",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "By this time, the F.I.R. also had been registered."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "08f6ac2781654a3f8a8d77b8bdc7b151_138",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "P.W.4, as we have noted, has admitted that he never made any statement before the police; Patna High Court CR. APP (DB) No.202 of 2016 dt.03-05-2024 rather he gave his statement for the first time before the Trial Court."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "43dcc046f7134f74ae6b1b38840eb7f3_139",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Even otherwise, his statement was necessarily to be recorded as he had never become unconscious."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "af07ff778425415c814670359e40b458_140",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "29. We are somewhat flummoxed to look for the reason for P.W. 4 or his brothers to unnecessarily raise allegations against the appellants, if the prosecution version was to be believed."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "d809e8bbbb1845409163ad14e4402562_141",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "30. We do not find any."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "6af833542d054a268dc873bd6173ccec_142",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "31. Nonetheless, with the non-examination of the I.O. and the Doctor and absolute failure of the prosecution to bring on record papers suggesting treatment to P.W. 4, the story of the prosecution must be rejected."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "eb7b69e58a974699b834dce0aba6e337_143",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\nBinod Das vs The State Of Bihar on 3 May, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/131954653/\n7 32."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "f33cad87eb0741e8804aed8428baf622_144",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
